<section id="slide-org07b6f09">
<h3 id="org07b6f09">Impuls (aka bevægelsesmængde)</h3>
<p>
\[p \equiv m \cdot v\]
</p>
<p class="fragment (appear)">
eller med vektorer
\[\vec{p} \equiv m \cdot \vec{v}\]
</p>

</section>
<section id="slide-org2278020">
<h3 id="org2278020">N2 igen</h3>
<ul>
<li class="fragment appear">\(\vec{F}_{res} = \frac{d \vec{p}}{d t}\)</li>
<li class="fragment appear">\(\vec{F}_{res} = \frac{d (m \cdot \vec{v})}{d t}\)</li>
<li class="fragment appear">\(\vec{F}_{res} = m \cdot \frac{d \vec{v}}{d t}\)</li>
<li class="fragment appear">\(\vec{F}_{res} = m \cdot \vec{a}\)</li>

</ul>

</section>
<section id="slide-org5337343">
<h3 id="org5337343">Makro</h3>
<p>
\[\vec{F}_{res} = \frac{\Delta \vec{p}}{\Delta t}\]
</p>

</section>
<section id="slide-orgc916033">
<h3 id="orgc916033">Impulsændring</h3>
<p>
\[\Delta \vec{p} = \vec{F}_{res} \cdot \Delta t\]
</p>

<ul>
<li class="fragment appear">Hvis \(\vec{F}_{res} = \vec{0}\)</li>
<li class="fragment appear">\(\Delta p = 0\)</li>
<li class="fragment appear">\(p= \text{konstant}\)</li>
<li class="fragment appear">Kaldes <i>impulsbevarelse</i>.</li>

</ul>

</section>
