<section id="slide-org5322f95-split">

<h3>Jord og Måne som ét system</h3>
<div style="font-size: 60%;">
<div class="column" style="float:left; width: 50%">
<p class="fragment (appear)">
Impulsændring på Jorden (1)
</p>
<ul>
<li class="fragment appear">\(\Delta \vec{p}_1 = \vec{F}_{y1}\cdot \Delta t + \vec{F}_{i1} \cdot \Delta t\)</li>
<li class="fragment appear">\(\Delta \vec{p}_1= \left( \vec{F}_{y1}+\vec{F}_{i1} \right)\cdot \Delta t\)</li>

</ul>
<p class="fragment (appear)">
Impulsændring på Månen (2)
</p>
<ul>
<li class="fragment appear">\(\Delta \vec{p}_2 = \vec{F}_{y2}\cdot \Delta t + \vec{F}_{i2} \cdot \Delta t\)</li>
<li class="fragment appear">\(\Delta \vec{p}_2= \left( \vec{F}_{y2}+\vec{F}_{i2} \right)\cdot \Delta t\)</li>

</ul>
</div>

<div class="column" style="float:right; width: 50%">

<div class="figure">
