<section id="slide-orga89966a">
<h3 id="orga89966a">Massemidtpunktets hastighed</h3>
<div style="font-size: 60%;">
<ul>
<li class="fragment appear">\(\vec{v}_T = \frac{\Delta \vec{r}_T}{\Delta t}\)</li>
<li class="fragment appear">\(\vec{v}_T = \frac{\sum_i \frac{m_i \Delta \vec{r}_i}{M}}{\Delta t}\)</li>
<li class="fragment appear">\(\vec{v}_T = \frac{1}{M}\cdot \sum_i m_i \boxed{\frac{ \Delta \vec{r}_i}{\Delta t}}\)</li>
<li class="fragment appear">\(\vec{v}_T = \frac{1}{M}\cdot \sum_i m_i \boxed{\vec{v}_i}\)</li>
<li class="fragment appear">Systemets samlede impuls er \(\vec{p}_\text{total} = \sum_i m_i \vec{v}_i\).</li>
<li class="fragment appear">\(\boxed{\vec{p}_\text{total} = M \cdot \vec{v}_T}\)</li>

</ul>

<blockquote  class="fragment (appear)">
<p>
Massemidtpunktets impuls er lige hele systemets impuls.
</p>
</blockquote>

</section>
<section id="slide-orga575b30">
<h3 id="orga575b30">Massemidtpunktets acceleration</h3>
<div style="font-size: 60%;">
<div class="column" style="float:left; width: 70%">
<ul>
<li class="fragment appear">\(\vec{a}_T = \frac{\Delta \vec{v}_T}{\Delta t}\)</li>
<li class="fragment appear">\(\vec{a}_T = \frac{1}{M} \sum_i m_i \frac{\Delta \vec{v}_i}{\Delta t}\)</li>
<li class="fragment appear">\(\vec{a}_T = \frac{\sum_i m_i \vec{a}_i}{M}\)</li>
<li class="fragment appear">\(m_i \vec{a}_i = \vec{F}_i\)</li>
<li class="fragment appear">\(\vec{F}_i = \vec{F}_{yi} + \vec{F}_{ii}\)</li>
<li class="fragment appear">\(M \vec{a}_T = \sum_i m_i \vec{a}_i\)</li>
<li class="fragment appear">\(M \vec{a}_T = \sum_i \left( \vec{F}_{yi}+ \vec{F}_{ii} \right)\)</li>
<li class="fragment appear">\(M \vec{a}_T = \sum_i \vec{F}_{yi}+ \boxed{\sum_i \vec{F}_{ii}}\)</li>
<li class="fragment appear">\(M \vec{a}_T = \sum_i \vec{F}_{yi}\)</li>

</ul>
</div>

