<div class="figure">
<p><img src="img/2019-12-17_13-05-29_screenshot.png" alt="2019-12-17_13-05-29_screenshot.png" width="600px" />
</p>
</div>
<ul>
<li class="fragment appear">\(\vec{F}_y = \sum_i \vec{F}_{yi}\)</li>

</ul>
</div>

